  "description": "Athletic Fashion Figure | 18 Poses\nCreate energetic and dynamic fashion sketches with this collection of 18 athletic fashion figure poses for Procreate.\nDesigned for fashion designers, fashion students, illustrators, apparel brands, and creative professionals, this brush set features active and movement-focused poses that are perfect for sportswear, activewear, athleisure collections, fitness-inspired fashion concepts, and contemporary womenswear development.\nThe Athletic Collection captures motion, confidence, and natural body movement, making it easier to visualize performance garments and lifestyle apparel designs.\nSimply stamp a pose onto your canvas, lower the opacity, create a new layer, and begin designing immediately.\nWHAT’S INCLUDED\n• 18 Athletic Fashion Figure Poses\n• Procreate Brush Set (.brushset)\n• High-Quality Fashion Figure Bases\n• Installation Guide\n• Preview Images\nPERFECT FOR\n• Fashion Designers\n• Fashion Students\n• Fashion Illustrators\n• Sportswear Designers\n• Activewear Brands\n• Apparel Brands\n• Procreate Users\n• Digital Artists\nUSE FOR\n• Fashion Sketching\n• Sportswear Design\n• Activewear Design\n• Athleisure Collections\n• Fashion Illustration\n• Collection Planning\n• Portfolio Development\n• Client Presentations\n• Digital Fashion Design\nFEATURES\n• 18 Athletic Fashion Figure Poses\n• Professional Fashion Proportions\n• Dynamic and Active Poses\n• Easy Stamp Workflow\n• Time-Saving Design Resource\n• Optimized for Procreate\n• Perfect for Beginners and Professionals\nCOMPATIBILITY\nCompatible with Procreate for iPad.\nPlease ensure that Procreate is installed before purchasing.\nPLEASE NOTE\nThis is a digital download product. No physical item will be shipped.\nABOUT HYDNSTUDIO\nHYDNSTUDIO creates professional fashion design resources for designers, students, apparel brands, and creative studios worldwide.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Athletic Fashion Figure | 18 Poses</p>\n<p>Create energetic and dynamic fashion sketches with this collection of 18 athletic fashion figure poses for Procreate.</p>\n<p>Designed for fashion designers, fashion students, illustrators, apparel brands, and creative professionals, this brush set features active and movement-focused poses that are perfect for sportswear, activewear, athleisure collections, fitness-inspired fashion concepts, and contemporary womenswear development.</p>\n<p>The Athletic Collection captures motion, confidence, and natural body movement, making it easier to visualize performance garments and lifestyle apparel designs.</p>\n<p>Simply stamp a pose onto your canvas, lower the opacity, create a new layer, and begin designing immediately.</p>\n<p>WHAT’S INCLUDED</p>\n<p>• 18 Athletic Fashion Figure Poses<br>\n• Procreate Brush Set (.brushset)<br>\n• High-Quality Fashion Figure Bases<br>\n• Installation Guide<br>\n• Preview Images</p>\n<p>PERFECT FOR</p>\n<p>• Fashion Designers<br>\n• Fashion Students<br>\n• Fashion Illustrators<br>\n• Sportswear Designers<br>\n• Activewear Brands<br>\n• Apparel Brands<br>\n• Procreate Users<br>\n• Digital Artists</p>\n<p>USE FOR</p>\n<p>• Fashion Sketching<br>\n• Sportswear Design<br>\n• Activewear Design<br>\n• Athleisure Collections<br>\n• Fashion Illustration<br>\n• Collection Planning<br>\n• Portfolio Development<br>\n• Client Presentations<br>\n• Digital Fashion Design</p>\n<p>FEATURES</p>\n<p>• 18 Athletic Fashion Figure Poses<br>\n• Professional Fashion Proportions<br>\n• Dynamic and Active Poses<br>\n• Easy Stamp Workflow<br>\n• Time-Saving Design Resource<br>\n• Optimized for Procreate<br>\n• Perfect for Beginners and Professionals</p>\n<p>COMPATIBILITY</p>\n<p>Compatible with Procreate for iPad.</p>\n<p>Please ensure that Procreate is installed before purchasing.</p>\n<p>PLEASE NOTE</p>\n<p>This is a digital download product. No physical item will be shipped.</p>\n<p>ABOUT HYDNSTUDIO</p>\n<p>HYDNSTUDIO creates professional fashion design resources for designers, students, apparel brands, and creative studios worldwide.</p>",
